@baseUrl = http://localhost:4101

### Process liveness; does not require a database or identity provider.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Identity configuration status; does not authenticate a user.
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/status

### Controller API description, available in Development only.
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### Dependency readiness; returns 503 until SQL Server and Redis are configured.
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### Business routes require the normal Entra session and workspace selection.
### Use the existing frontend gateway for authenticated application workflows.
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets?page=1&pageSize=25
